<title>DENMARK: Lauritzen shipping goes into profit in 96.</title>
<headline>Lauritzen shipping goes into profit in 96.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish shipping and shipbuilding group J.Lauritzen on Friday said that its shipping unit made pre-tax profit of 11 million crowns in 1996, compared to a 26 million crown loss the year before.</p>
<p>The unit said that it expected further slight improvement in 1997.</p>
<p>Total group earnings are to be published in late March.</p>
<p>--Soeren Linding Jakobsen, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969653</p>
